      "created_at": "2025-03-20T13:20:21.507Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello<br>\nWe’re facing issues regarding the <em>“Balance Value”</em> column in <em>“Stock Balance”</em> report.<br>\nSome items with zero <em>“Balance Qty”</em>, have a positive or negative non-zero <em>“Balance Value”</em>, even though the same item’s <em>“Balance Value”</em> appears as zero in <em>“Stock Ledger”</em> report.</p>\n<p>I searched the forums and found some threads regarding the same issue, but non of the mentioned solutions worked.</p>\n<p>Here is an example of one of the items with zero qty and non-zero value:</p>\n<p><strong>Stock Balance:</strong><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/c/5c1dcf28291ea3f194eea400134f41516e246620.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5c1dcf28291ea3f194eea400134f41516e246620\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/c/5c1dcf28291ea3f194eea400134f41516e246620_2_690x85.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"d8TNb6A9lbSLtT26FRml7nSDCgw\" width=\"690\" height=\"85\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/c/5c1dcf28291ea3f194eea400134f41516e246620_2_690x85.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/c/5c1dcf28291ea3f194eea400134f41516e246620_2_1035x127.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/c/5c1dcf28291ea3f194eea400134f41516e246620.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"22272D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1125×140 13.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><strong>Stock Ledger:</strong><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/8/8853bce2932493d9bf11ff24e045997862d17ed4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8853bce2932493d9bf11ff24e045997862d17ed4\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/8/8853bce2932493d9bf11ff24e045997862d17ed4_2_690x141.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"js0lifXt7xeKQun7pQDFPUzWvIg\" width=\"690\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/8/8853bce2932493d9bf11ff24e045997862d17ed4_2_690x141.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/8/8853bce2932493d9bf11ff24e045997862d17ed4_2_1035x211.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/8/8853bce2932493d9bf11ff24e045997862d17ed4.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"23282D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1136×233 26.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>How can we fix <em>“Balance Value”</em> for all items?</p>",
