      "id": 479798,
      "username": "YamanQD",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-09-03T08:45:19.187Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Update:<br>\nWe found out where the wrong <em>“Balance Value”</em> comes from. It comes from the <em>“Value Change”</em> column in Stock Ledger report not adding up to (0).</p>\n<p><strong>Example: Item “CP965”</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>(Stock Balance Report):</strong> The item has a quantity of (0) but a non-zero stock value of (4.03).<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/6/86a8a2a4125b7d28df93dedbab6ee0f01b08752f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/86a8a2a4125b7d28df93dedbab6ee0f01b08752f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/6/86a8a2a4125b7d28df93dedbab6ee0f01b08752f.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"jdfhooaTLOdjw9xyLi9mYUQSFNt\" width=\"690\" height=\"117\" data-dominant-color=\"22272C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">830×141 10 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>(Stock Ledger Report):</strong> The sum of the “Value Change” column is <strong>4.025</strong>, not the expected value of <strong>0.00</strong>.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/9/79624c11fc917e22f6af5952d98228f4ee70ec81.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/79624c11fc917e22f6af5952d98228f4ee70ec81\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79624c11fc917e22f6af5952d98228f4ee70ec81_2_690x195.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hjOndWEOs8EgQfnXohaSQXTFVAt\" width=\"690\" height=\"195\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79624c11fc917e22f6af5952d98228f4ee70ec81_2_690x195.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79624c11fc917e22f6af5952d98228f4ee70ec81_2_1035x292.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/9/79624c11fc917e22f6af5952d98228f4ee70ec81.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"22272D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1242×352 40.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> All stock transactions shown in (Stock Ledger Report) regarding this item and warehouse, are “Stock Entries” of the type “Material Transfer”.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
